	"h6InfernoSuccubus": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Temptress",
			"plural": "Temptresses"
		},
		"description": "Some of Asha's children (humans, elves, dwarves and others) pledge themselves to Urgash and the Demon Lords of Sheogh; after death the men are reborn as incubi and the women as Temptresses. Reborn as demon cultists, they hold a fairly high and unusual place in the demonic hierarchy. Yet although their wisdom, loyalty and power should be enough to earn them rank, many demon cultists end up as lowly incubi and Temptresses (as servants, sex slaves and the like). Because of their origins they usually serve as spies, infiltrators and diplomats, so they excel at illusion, enthrallment and shapeshifting. As beautiful and charming as angels, their sensual, physical allure lets them sway beings of weaker will. In the rise of any demon cult, incubi and Temptresses are bound to appear.",
