	"h6InfernoBreeder": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Breeder",
			"plural": "Breeders"
		},
		"description": "Breeders are what Urgash got when he tried to create bodies infused with part of his own primal desires: among them the desire to devour magic, and the desire to drown Ashan in a tide of creatures loyal to the Lord of Chaos. Ruled over by Ur-Akkil, Demon Lord of Proliferation, the Breeder is a bloated creature whose huge, pulsing body never stops giving birth to Devil Spawn. The Spawn she bears spurt out of the many holes that open and close all over her body. Though this demon can barely move, she twitches and writhes constantly, driven by her endless urge to breed. This urge to give birth consumes her and tries to burst out of her body, and most of her energy must go into holding back her own mutations. Sometimes she eats the Spawn she has borne; the magic she devours is used to make herself fertile, to feed herself and to hold back the hideous deformities caused by her endless breeding.",
